. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">᠀᠒ᠽᠻᠳᡙ᠒ᢀᠰᠱᠦᠦᡕᡠᠧᠭᡜᡓᡙᡍᡙᡭᡮᢠᢡᡖᠵᡭᡆᡆᡔᡙᡓᠻᢠᢋᢀᠩᢒᡓᡰᠭ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":526.51,"y":414.98,"cell":8186,"i":96,"name":"Invelere Monolith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient monolith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">⳪ⲼⳊ ⲲⳄⳭⳐ Ⲻ⳹Ⳍ⳥ ⳜⲼⲲⳬⳲⳈ⳥ⳤⳜⳘ⳥Ⳳ⳪ⳤⳁⳜⳠⳫⳄⳢⳄⲾⳬⲶⳤⳢⳭⲸⲶⳫ ⳧ⳔⳌⳊ ⳃⳁⳲⳊ ⲺⳤⲸⳄⳒ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":268.57,"y":317.9,"cell":4839,"i":97,"name":"Biderid Megalith","tags":[],"note":"An ancient megalith. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ጰበሠገደመከገሰሰረበአቀ የረዐከተኀጰጠነዐሰሠቀደበጠሀነአተደሰሠኀገፈኀቀሰዐለመደቀጸመዐአጠሰለመጸጰቀ  ፈሰሰፀ ሐተዐወነከሰዘ ፐሀከ ፐጸ  ደመቀሠረጰሠ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":491.98,"y":721.36,"cell":17438,"i":98,"name":"Vinolisano Obelisk","tags":[],"note":"An ancient obelisk. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">༻༢༇༰་༮༻༥༻༇༮༠༵༶༆༠༥༪༙༩༐༠༴༩༈༰༡༽༒༆༊༛༥༂༉༊༹༚༩༲༴༥༲༫༖༹༂༱༇༔༵༫༷༕༁༾༩༁༄༪༆</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":254.1,"y":308,"cell":4305,"i":99,"name":"Laundon Stele","tags":[],"note":"An ancient stele. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802\ud802𐠠𐠮\udc19\udc34\ud802𐠪𐠩\udc3c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 \udc26𐠧\ud802\ud802 \ud802𐠡 \ud802𐠛\udc2e\udc24\ud802𐠌𐠒\ud802\ud802 \udc03𐠖\udc12\udc1c\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802\ud802 𐠥𐠐\ud802𐠠\udc02𐠔\ud802𐠙𐠈\ud802𐠃\udc29\ud802\ud802 \udc1e\ud802𐠪\udc21\udc16\udc29 \udc17\udc13\udc24\ud802\ud802 \udc25</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":1042.9,"y":682.5,"cell":16236,"i":100,"name":"Bozsu Column","tags":[],"note":"An ancient column. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᠨᢛᠦᡎᢥᢛᡗᠡᢋᠽᢑᡡᢥᡞᡲᠮᡮᡮᠦᠯᢏᠽᡆᠾᡟᡯᢥᡝᡯᠽᢐᠭᢥᠦᠡᡗᡠᠮᡏᠲᢤ᠀ᢜᠡᠨᠧᢒ᠒ᡠᡲᡠᡏᠼᢟᢜᢓᡙᢀ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":775.43,"y":818.68,"cell":19497,"i":101,"name":"Leiralenha Runestone","tags":[],"note":"An ancient runestone. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">ᡲᡟᢒᠿᠯᡏᢓᠡᡓᡎᢁᠨᡁᡱᡠᠳᡆᢦᠭᡏᢁᡏᡮᢟᢤᢒᡒᢞᢠᢁᡠᠮᡐᠵᠡᠯᡲᡖᢑᡖᡮᡀᠿᡱᢞᡎᡑᠿᠦᡡ᠀ᠱᡍᢡᡓᡴᡔᡆ᠐ᢑᠰᢡᠩᠰᢞᡔᢦᡳᡜ</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f5ff","type":"statues","x":890.9,"y":766.9,"cell":18589,"i":102,"name":"Forteiveira Pillar","tags":[],"note":"An ancient pillar. It has an inscription, but no one can translate it:\n        <div style=\"font-size: 1.8em; line-break: anywhere;\">\ud802 \udc08𐠢\udc1c\udc15𐠄\udc24\udc1b𐠗\ud802𐠩\udc04\udc19𐠷 \udc28\udc3f𐠰\ud802\ud802  \udc16\ud802𐠦\udc02\udc27\ud802\ud802𐠋\udc12\udc2f\udc28\udc27\udc29𐠥𐠙\udc33\udc1c\ud802\ud802  \udc04\udc2c\udc29\ud802\ud802𐠧\ud802\ud802\ud802𐠯\ud802𐠳\ud802\ud802𐠙\udc05𐠔\udc37\udc2d\udc0a𐠙\udc19\udc0d</div>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":743.25,"y":482.88,"cell":10348,"i":103,"name":"Ruined Stronghold","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient stronghold. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1540.27,"y":485.73,"cell":10463,"i":104,"name":"Ruined Settlement","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1479.75,"y":289.39,"cell":3973,"i":105,"name":"Ruined Fortress","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient fortress. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":1592.39,"y":503.23,"cell":10911,"i":106,"name":"Ruined Settlement","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient settlement. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":468.93,"y":159.54,"cell":907,"i":107,"name":"Ruined Pyramid","tags":[],"note":"Ruins of an ancient pyramid. Untold riches may lie within."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3fa","type":"ruins","x":395.13,"y":638.23,"cell":14917,"