king circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":904.25,"y":354.86,"cell":6291,"i":119,"name":"Travelling Unmissable Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this unmissable circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":1360.37,"y":477.59,"cell":10211,"i":120,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3aa","type":"circuses","x":682.49,"y":706.14,"cell":17044,"i":121,"name":"Travelling Extraordinary Circus","tags":[],"note":"Roll up, roll up, this extraordinary circus is here for a limited time only."},{"icon":"glyph-1f93a","type":"jousts","dx":48,"x":849.97,"y":303.68,"cell":4140,"i":122,"name":"Frampton Contest","tags":[],"note":"Warriors from around the land gather for a contest of cunning in Frampton, with fame, fortune and favour on offer to the victor."},{"icon":"glyph-1f3a0","type":"fairs","x":668.54,"y":352.17,"cell":5985,"i":123,"name":"Inver Fair","tags":[],"note":"A fair is being held in Inver, offering local horses, preserved food, and leather alongside foreign goods and services."},{"icon":"glyph-1f6f6","type":"canoes","x":613.3,"y":392.8,"cell":7473,"i":124,"name":"Minor Jetty","tags":[],"note":"A small location along the Inbhuronning Fork to launch boats from sits here, along with a weary looking owner, willing to sell passage along the river."},{"icon":"glyph-1f417","type":"migration","x":1127.9,"y":573,"cell":13073,"i":125,"name":"Antelopes migration","tags":[],"note":"A huge group of antelopes are migrating, whether part of their annual routine, or something more extraordinary."},{"icon":"glyph-1f483-1f3fd","type":"dances","x":833.67,"y":207.16,"cell":1635,"i":126,"name":"Sholeford performance","tags":[],"note":"A performance has been organised at Sholeford as a chance to gather the foreign dignitaries of the area together to be merry, make alliances and scheme around the crisis."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4a6","type":"mirage","x":1302.68,"y":476.12,"cell":10203,"i":127,"name":"Peculiar mirage","tags":[],"note":"This peculiar mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"icon":"glyph-1f4a6","type":"mirage","x":1199.99,"y":738.67,"cell":17913,"i":128,"name":"Entrancing mirage","tags":[],"note":"This entrancing mirage has been luring travellers out of their way for eons."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":1372.58,"y":398.1,"cell":7821,"i":129,"name":"Varvi Chasm","tags":[],"note":"The Varvi Chasm. Locals claim that it is the home of strange monsters."},{"icon":"glyph-1f987","type":"caves","x":576.74,"y":467.06,"cell":9663,"i":130,"name":"Abedinver Cavern","tags":[],"note":"The Abedinver Cavern. Locals claim that it is a good spot to hid treasure."},{"icon":"glyph-1faa6","type":"necropolises","x":421.02,"y":676.1,"cell":15957,"i":131,"name":"Poncigio Tomb","tags":[],"note":"A foreboding necropolis perched atop a jagged cliff, overlooking a desolate wasteland. Its towering walls harbor restless spirits, and the imposing gates bear the marks of countless battles and ancient curses."},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":1384.35,"y":216.63,"cell":2009,"i":132,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/2009\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":462.15,"y":436.25,"cell":8838,"i":133,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe src=\"https://deorum.vercel.app/encounter/8838\" width=\"375\" height=\"600\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups\"></iframe>"},{"icon":"glyph-1f9d9","type":"encounters","x":900.83,"y":675.89,"cell":16024,"i":134,"name":"Random encounter","tags":[],"note":"<div>You have encountered a character.</div><iframe